5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The fee structure is opaque. I need to understand the actual costs before we decide anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the sentiment, Asuka. But before we dissect the costs, let’s ensure the person actually doing the counting doesn’t vanish into a black hole of paperwork.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Benjamin. The workload matters as much as the money. I want to see who is truly carrying the administrative burden before we adjust the fees.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m not worried about the money. I’m worried about the silence. Why do regulars hesitate to show up now?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I refuse to guess again. We need hard numbers on what we can actually count on, not vague hopes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
